## 4. REMAINING

Ordered by what blocks the most. IDs match `HANDOFF.md` §6 where they exist.

### Immediate / cheap
- [ ] Regenerate `results/table.md` and `results/table_heldout_final.md` — both
      contain run-log output instead of tables.
- [ ] **P2 — seeds produce zero variance.** `do_sample=False` makes decoding
      deterministic, so all 5 seeds are byte-identical and the table reports
      `± 0.000`. Reporting "5 seeds" with zero std implies variability was
      measured when it was not. Fix: route the seed through *dataset
      construction* (value selection, age/sex, distractor labs), emit
      `data/seed{N}/`, let `run_eval.py` take `--data`.
      Acceptance: non-zero std; qualitative ordering of rows 1–3 survives.
- [ ] Run `src/perplexity.py` on WikiText-2 — the pre-intervention baseline
      RQ3 needs. Written, never executed.

### Blocking the science
- [ ] **P6 / Aim 1 — nothing exists.** SAE on middle-layer activations, Feature
      Interpretability Score `FIS = α·S_semantic + β·S_causal + γ·S_human`,
      sparse concept probing classifiers, stability across layers/prompts/seeds.
      Fallback to JumpReLU or TopK SAE if <30% of features pass expert
      validation. Needs more GPU than one 4090 for the SAE stage.
- [ ] **P6 / Aim 2 — nothing exists.** Causal necessity (knock-out), causal
      sufficiency (injection), Average Causal Effect
      `ACE(Δf) = E[Y|do(F+Δf)] − E[Y|do(F)]`, negative controls on random
      features. Note the existing counterfactual pairs are minimal pairs and are
      the right substrate for this.
- [ ] **P5 / Aim 3 — the gate is not the proposal's layer.** Current gate is a
      post-hoc check on output text. The proposal specifies a residual-stream
      adapter modifying hidden states before decoding, under a joint objective
      `L = L_LM + λ1·L_ontology + λ2·L_causal + λ3·L_uncertainty`.
      Must not be presented as the proposal's intervention layer.

### Data provenance
- [ ] **P4 — thresholds still hand-written.** `constraint_value` is empty on all
      145 worksheet rows. Requires a human to transcribe numbers from the
      quoted source sentences. 2 of 10 drugs returned nothing from openFDA.
- [ ] UMLS / UTS account — free, registration takes days (per `HANDOFF.md`).
- [ ] MIMIC-IV via PhysioNet — CITI training takes weeks (per `HANDOFF.md`).
      Note the **Demo v2.2 is open access with no credentialing**, ODbL, 100
      patients, all 26 tables including `labevents` and `prescriptions`, but no
      free-text notes.

### Optional / deferred
- [ ] P1 self-consistency (k=5 samples at temperature > 0, answer disagreement
      rate). Breaks the deterministic-decoding guarantee that makes the paired
      McNemar tests valid, so it needs its own variant row.
- [ ] External-validity run on a public dataset. Candidates researched:
      `ncbi/MedCalc-Bench-v1.2`, `ncbi/Open-Patients`, `aai530-group6/ddxplus`,
      RxSafeBench, MedHallu.

